    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Hardware performance counters, sampling, and profiling",
      "source_hash": 10236131803025790185,
      "context_hash": 5621109922758694083,
      "translation": "하드웨어 성능 카운터, 샘플링, 프로파일링",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hardware": "하드웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:19:51.840198Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What perf events are",
      "source_hash": 17742043010884244753,
      "context_hash": 10557513972989186753,
      "translation": "perf 이벤트란 무엇인가",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "perf": "perf"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:19:51.840199Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The perf events subsystem was created by Ingo Molnár and Peter Zijlstra and introduced in Linux 2.6.31 [(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/337493/). `perf_event_open` is the Linux syscall for accessing performance monitoring hardware:",
      "source_hash": 16863256778817926228,
      "context_hash": 5177505533952452743,
      "translation": "perf 이벤트 서브시스템은 Ingo Molnár와 Peter Zijlstra가 만들었으며 Linux 2.6.31에서 도입되었습니다 [(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/337493/). `perf_event_open`은 성능 모니터링 하드웨어에 접근하기 위한 Linux 시스템 콜입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "LWN": "LWN",
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "hardware": "하드웨어",
        "perf": "perf",
        "subsystem": "서브시스템",
        "syscall": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:19:51.840199Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**Hardware counters** (PMU): CPU cycles, instructions, cache misses, branch mispredictions",
      "source_hash": 10716263395155222011,
      "context_hash": 18278840290879453871,
      "translation": "**하드웨어 카운터** (PMU): CPU 사이클, 명령어, 캐시 미스, 분기 예측 실패",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "cache": "캐시",
        "hardware": "하드웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:19:51.840199Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**Software counters**: page faults, context switches, CPU migrations",
      "source_hash": 3999733579623920444,
      "context_hash": 826325111559665652,
      "translation": "**소프트웨어 카운터**: 페이지 폴트, 컨텍스트 스위치, CPU 마이그레이션",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "context switches": "컨텍스트 스위치",
        "page faults": "페이지 폴트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:19:51.840200Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**Tracepoints**: static kernel events",
      "source_hash": 8692220247792486828,
      "context_hash": 1211278964538791381,
      "translation": "**트레이스포인트**: 정적 커널 이벤트",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "tracepoints": "트레이스포인트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:19:51.840200Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "**Dynamic events**: kprobes, uprobes, BPF",
      "source_hash": 4958866833802208885,
      "context_hash": 11019945234115713269,
      "translation": "**동적 이벤트**: kprobe, uprobe, BPF",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "BPF": "BPF",
        "kprobes": "kprobe"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:19:51.840200Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "**Sampling**: record PC/stack every N events for statistical profiling",
      "source_hash": 10420515081376084744,
      "context_hash": 10424645613661035539,
      "translation": "**샘플링**: 통계적 프로파일링을 위해 N개 이벤트마다 PC/스택을 기록",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:19:51.840200Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "perf_event_open syscall",
      "source_hash": 2559595962816608912,
      "context_hash": 16145722986173779034,
