      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "syscall": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:19:51.840201Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Event types",
      "source_hash": 17345856099881257014,
      "context_hash": 6975572171349323690,
      "translation": "이벤트 유형",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:19:51.840201Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Sampling mode",
      "source_hash": 17015099522546215160,
      "context_hash": 10654523211543901198,
      "translation": "샘플링 모드",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:19:51.840201Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Sampling records the instruction pointer (and optionally call stack) every N events:",
      "source_hash": 7683644561647007675,
      "context_hash": 4174414501794283181,
      "translation": "샘플링은 N개 이벤트마다 명령어 포인터(및 선택적으로 콜 스택)를 기록합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:19:51.840201Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Samples are written to an `mmap`'d ring buffer (the perf mmap buffer):",
      "source_hash": 14710805176365004532,
      "context_hash": 8158422429762198868,
      "translation": "샘플은 `mmap`된 링 버퍼(perf mmap 버퍼)에 기록됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "perf": "perf",
        "ring buffer": "링 버퍼"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:19:51.840201Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
